<model><name>barrier_gate</name><version>1.0</version><sdf version="1.6">model.sdf</sdf><description>boom barrier, no motion in the description: link "base" (fixed to the world) + link "arm" (kinematic, no gravity; its frame is the pivot, closed = zero rotation, open = pitch -90 deg about Y), counterweight, rest cradle, stop bracket</description></model>
